.IX Title "AMSPUB 1"
.TH AMSPUB 1 2025-11-26 "perl v5.38.2" "AMS executables"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
amspub \- Asynchronous Message Service (AMS) test driver for VxWorks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBamspub\fR "\fIapplication_name\fR", "\fIauthority_name\fR", "\fIsubject_name\fR", "\fImessage_text\fR"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBamspub\fR is a message publication program designed to test AMS functionality
in a VxWorks environment.  When an \fBamspub\fR task is started, it registers
as an application module in the root unit of the venture identified by
\&\fIapplication_name\fR and \fIauthority_name\fR, looks up the subject number for
\&\fIsubject_name\fR, publishes a single message with content \fImessage_text\fR on
that subject, unregisters, and terminates.
.PP
A configuration server for the local continuum and a registrar for the root
unit of the indicated venture (which may both be instantiated in a single
\&\fBamsd\fR daemon task) must be running in order for \fBamspub\fR to run.
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.IX Header "EXIT STATUS"
.IP \-1 4
.IX Item "-1"
\&\fBamspub\fR terminated with an error as noted in the ion.log file.
.IP """0""" 4
.IX Item """0"""
\&\fBamspub\fR terminated normally.
.SH FILES
.IX Header "FILES"
The \fBamspub\fR source code is in the amspubsub.c source file.
.PP
A MIB initialization file with the applicable default name (see \fBamsrc\fR\|(5))
must be present.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.IX Header "ENVIRONMENT"
No environment variables apply.
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.IX Header "DIAGNOSTICS"
.IP "amspub can't register." 4
.IX Item "amspub can't register."
\&\fBamspub\fR failed to register, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.IP "amspub: subject is unknown" 4
.IX Item "amspub: subject is unknown"
\&\fBamspub\fR can't publish test messages on the specified subject; possibly
an error in the MIB initialization file.
.IP "amspub can't publish message." 4
.IX Item "amspub can't publish message."
\&\fBamspub\fR failed to publish, for reasons noted in the ion.log file.
.SH BUGS
.IX Header "BUGS"
Report bugs to <https://github.com/nasa\-jpl/ION\-DTN/issues>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBamssub\fR\|(1), \fBamsrc\fR\|(5)
